silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_03_concrete_anchor_3#prescribedkibblebrand silm:hasLongDescription "The PrescribedKibbleBrand is the prescribed kibble brand constituent. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Constituent5,1', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
